WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.734
-Good evening.

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:02.768
I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:04.103
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:05.371
Now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:08.074
After the White House
announced last week

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:10.576
that the construction
will resume on the border wall,

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:12.645
President Biden told reporters,

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.814
"I was told that
I had no choice."

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:17.316
Oh, man, I have a bad feeling
we're gonna find out

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:21.154
this was all the work of one
really good telemarketer.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:22.822
[ As Biden ] They said
if I build a border wall,

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.623
I get three months
of Spectrum Internet.

00:00:24.623 --> 00:00:27.226
I had to do it.

00:00:27.226 --> 00:00:28.928
[ Normal voice ]
According to a new analysis,

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:30.963
over one-third
of Supreme Court decisions

00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:32.165
are decided unanimously.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:33.933
The other two-thirds are decided

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:36.769
by whoever took Clarence Thomas
on his last vacation.

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:38.705
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:42.375
The IRS last week placed a lien
on a Florida property

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.910
owned by Rudy Giuliani.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.812
I'm guessing
the Haunted Mansion?

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:47.847
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:50.617
[ As Giuliani ] It's all yours.

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:53.786
Those ghosts won't let me sleep.

00:00:53.786 --> 00:00:55.121
[ Normal voice ]
After leaving the White House,

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:57.190
former president Trump
reportedly shared details

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:59.491
about the capabilities
of U.S. nuclear submarines

00:00:59.491 --> 00:01:02.227
with an Australian billionaire,
including how close

00:01:02.227 --> 00:01:05.198
they can sail to Russian vessels
without being detected.

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:07.366
Said Trump, "Oh, come on,
I'm not an idiot.

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:09.202
I told Putin first."

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:11.403
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.403 --> 00:01:12.839
House Republicans
reportedly held

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:15.308
a phones-off, closed-door
meeting today

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:17.010
to discuss the speakership.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.577
And when they turned
their phones back on,

00:01:18.577 --> 00:01:21.814
Matt Gaetz had
three more Venmo requests.

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:24.784
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:26.685
New York governor Kathy Hochul

00:01:26.685 --> 00:01:28.320
ordered
the State Liquor Authority

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:32.291
to allow bars to serve alcohol
as early as 8:00 a.m. yesterday

00:01:32.291 --> 00:01:35.161
for the Buffalo Bills game
played in London.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.929
Not only that,
during the Giants game,

00:01:36.929 --> 00:01:39.632
she temporarily
legalized heroin.

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.768
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:48.007
The genetic testing company
23andMe announced last week

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.509
that hackers stole personal
data from their database.

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:52.211
Authorities described
the suspect

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:56.916
as 62% European and 38%
East Asian and Native American.

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:58.717
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.717 --> 00:02:01.086
Georgia is said to become
the first state in the country

00:02:01.086 --> 00:02:03.188
to offer medical marijuana
at pharmacies.

00:02:03.188 --> 00:02:06.426
So you'll finally have a use
for that giant receipt.

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:10.295
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.295 --> 00:02:13.098
Burger King has announced
that it will offer a new side

00:02:13.098 --> 00:02:15.568
that is half French fries,
half onion rings.

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.703
Wow, the only way
you could get that before

00:02:17.703 --> 00:02:19.472
was to order onion rings.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.608
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:27.646
Best joke of the day.
It's a little bit --

00:02:27.646 --> 00:02:28.981
Still a really good show,

00:02:28.981 --> 00:02:31.184
but it's a little bit downhill
after the onion rings.

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:34.454
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:36.956
And finally, Google Cloud today
announced a new

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:40.126
artificial-intelligence-powered
search function for doctors,

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:42.695
because nothing inspires
confidence in your doctor

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:46.365
quite like hearing,
"Let's Google it."

00:02:46.365 --> 00:02:48.467
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:49.668
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:49.668 --> 00:02:51.337
We're off and running.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:59.412
It is never easy to make
a transition like this.

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:01.714
But I do want to address --

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:04.150
I'm sure you all are aware
of the atrocities

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.352
that were committed
against Israel this weekend.

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:09.188
They were monstrous
and horrific acts of violence.

00:03:09.188 --> 00:03:11.424
I will not pretend
to have any answers

00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:14.227
as to how to respond
to a crisis like this.

00:03:14.227 --> 00:03:16.628
I will only say
that in the moments

00:03:16.628 --> 00:03:20.500
when we are confronted
with such evil, inhumane acts,

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:24.136
we are most at risk
of losing our own humanity.

00:03:24.136 --> 00:03:29.108
When we are, justifiably,
blind with rage and sadness,

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:32.077
we can make choices
that will have massive,

00:03:32.077 --> 00:03:35.882
irrevocable impacts on the lives
of our fellow man.

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:38.818
It requires
the absolute best of us

00:03:38.818 --> 00:03:40.486
to think clearly
in times like this.

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:41.921
And I hope with all my heart

00:03:41.921 --> 00:03:46.759
the best of us can emerge in
this time of unthinkable loss.

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:50.430
Thank you, everybody,
for bearing with me to say that.

